  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "クズレス・オブリージュ　18禁ゲー世界のクズ悪役に転生してしまった俺は、原作知識の力でどうしてもモブ人生をつかみ取りたい"
   },
   {
    "en": "Scumless Oblige: Reborn as the Scummy Villain in an 18+ Adult Game, and I Absolutely Want to Seize the Mob Life Using My Knowledge of the Original Story"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Before I knew it, I was in a world of 18+ games with magic and erotica. In it, I was reborn as Ultos, the worst scum in history. If I continue like this, I will meet the worst possible fate. Somehow, I must be reborn from the hated character known as 'ScumUltos' into a pure and innocent mob character...!!",
